5,1,1,talk,Servas,,Hello everyone. It is time we discuss our utility bills. I believe we should find a way that ensures everyone feels comfortable and warm in their own home.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Servas. Harmony is so important in a shared house. I want us to find a solution that keeps us all friendly and happy.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I'm curious about how we've been doing it! I want to know if the way we split things is actually fair for everyone living here now.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make this quick and painless! I just want to make sure we aren't surprised by any huge costs or complicated rules.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. I just hope we can find a way that isn't too difficult to manage every month.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"To understand the atmosphere, I will look into the ""Winter habits at a house paying ahead"" and ""Sunlight and heating need by room.""","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'll check the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" and the ""Kitchen notice about the cooler"" to see if there have been any tensions.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I want to see the ""Plug-in monitor readings room by room"" and ""Settling up when the last rooms filled"" to see how usage differs!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"I'll take the ""The last twelve utility statements"" and the ""Electrician's quote for the rooms."" I need to see the actual numbers.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll look at the ""Monthly settle observed at another house"" and the ""Trial run of a reconciliation template"" to see the workload.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is wise to divide our research. By looking at different angles, we can ensure the heart of the home remains warm.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I think this is a very balanced approach. I'm looking forward to seeing if we can smooth over any past misunderstandings.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@May, do you think the electrician's quote will be expensive? I wonder if we can afford fancy new things!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, that's exactly why I'm checking! We can't just dream; we need to know if it'll break the bank.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll just... see how much time the paperwork takes. I don't want anyone to be too stressed.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
