35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"I have learned that some rooms are naturally colder, and in houses with fixed rates, people feel much freer to use the heat without guilt.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,It seems there have been some delays in payments and even some people avoiding the AC to avoid arguments. It's a bit sad.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"Wow! Some rooms use four times more power than others! Also, it took a long time to decide what the new people owed.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The bills are all over the place—February is way higher than August. And fitting meters would cost 34,000 yen per room plus annual fees.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The other house spent forty minutes just logging readings... and the template required keying in every single invoice. It seems like a lot of work.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, that difference in usage explains why some of us might feel the current split is unfair. We must address the physical reality of the rooms.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, it sounds like the administrative side is quite a burden. We shouldn't pick a system that makes the organizer miserable.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, 34,000 yen is a lot! Maybe we can't do the meters? But it's weird that some people use so much more power.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, it's very expensive. Plus, the volatility of the monthly bills means a simple split might feel like a shock some months.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Midori, thank you. I'm worried that if we make it too complex, someone will end up spending their whole evening on spreadsheets.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"If we continue to worry about every switch, we lose the peace of our home. We need a system that removes the fear of the bill.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree. If we can find a way to avoid the ""payment reminders"" that feel like accusations, our harmony will return.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,I think it's unfair that people with cold rooms or big computers pay the same as people who use almost nothing.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"But we can't afford the meters, and we can't afford a system that's a nightmare to calculate. We need something practical.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I think... maybe a simple system is better. If it's easy, there are fewer mistakes to argue about.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
